                        target="frus1945Berlinv02#d1005">vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>,
                        document No. 1005</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d390-f3" n="3" xml:id="d390-f3-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d386">document No. 386</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
